{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 🎯 WF-01: Enrollment Journey\n\n**Lead → Student Conversion Process**\n\nAverage Duration: 5-7 days\nConversion Rate: 40%","x":0,"y":-200,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"phase1","type":"file","file":"02-Workflows/WF-01 Enrollment Journey.md","x":-800,"y":0,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"phase1-text","type":"text","text":"## Phase 1: Lead Capture\n\n**Goal**: Capture potential customer info\n\n**Actors**:\n- Lead (customer)\n- [[Receptionist]]\n- [[Admission Consultant]]\n\n**Duration**: < 5 minutes\n\n**Channels**:\n- Website form\n- Phone call\n- Walk-in\n- Referral","x":-800,"y":250,"width":300,"height":350,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"phase2","type":"text","text":"## Phase 2: Consultation\n\n**Goal**: Understand needs, qualify lead\n\n**Actor**: [[Admission Consultant]]\n\n**Duration**: 30-60 minutes\n\n**Key Activities**:\n- Needs assessment\n- Program presentation\n- Pricing discussion\n- Q&A\n\n**Outcomes**:\n✅ Qualified → Assessment\n📅 Follow-up → Schedule callback\n❌ Unqualified → Mark lost","x":-400,"y":0,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"phase3","type":"text","text":"## Phase 3: Assessment\n\n**Goal**: Evaluate proficiency level\n\n**Actor**: [[Teacher]]\n\n**Duration**: 60-90 minutes\n\n**Components**:\n- Listening test (20 min)\n- Reading test (20 min)\n- Writing test (20 min)\n- Speaking interview (15 min)\n\n**Grading**: Within 24 hours\n\n**Outcome**: Placement in appropriate level","x":0,"y":0,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"phase4","type":"text","text":"## Phase 4: Enrollment & Payment\n\n**Goal**: Complete enrollment and payment\n\n**Actors**:\n- [[Admission Consultant]]\n- [[Finance Officer]]\n- Student\n\n**Duration**: 1-3 days\n\n**Steps**:\n1. Select class\n2. Create enrollment\n3. Generate invoice\n4. Collect payment:\n   - Online (60%)\n   - Cash (25%)\n   - Bank transfer (15%)\n5. Issue receipt","x":400,"y":0,"width":300,"height":450,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"phase5","type":"text","text":"## Phase 5: Activation\n\n**Goal**: Onboard student to LMS\n\n**Actor**: System (automated)\n\n**Duration**: Instant\n\n**Actions**:\n- Activate enrollment\n- Generate credentials\n- Send welcome email\n- Notify teacher\n- Grant LMS access\n- Add to class roster\n\n**Result**: Active student ready to learn! 🎉","x":800,"y":0,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"metrics","type":"text","text":"## 📊 Key Metrics\n\n**Conversion Funnel**:\n- Lead → Consultation: 80%\n- Consultation → Assessment: 60%\n- Assessment → Enrollment: 70%\n- Enrollment → Payment: 95%\n- **Overall**: 40% lead-to-student\n\n**Time Metrics**:\n- Lead response: <24 hours\n- Consultation to enrollment: <5 days\n- Payment to activation: <1 hour\n\n**Quality**:\n- First class show-up: 95%\n- Payment success: 98%","x":0,"y":500,"width":400,"height":450,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"roles","type":"text","text":"## 👥 Key Roles\n\n**Primary Driver**:\n[[Admission Consultant]]\n- Leads consultation\n- Creates enrollment\n- Drives conversion\n\n**Supporting**:\n[[Receptionist]] - Lead capture\n[[Teacher]] - Assessment\n[[Finance Officer]] - Payment\n[[Academic Manager]] - Program guidance\n[[Branch Manager]] - Approvals","x":-800,"y":700,"width":300,"height":350,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"exceptions","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ Exception Handling\n\n**Class Full**:\n→ Waitlist or alternative class\n\n**Payment Failed**:\n→ Retry or alternative method\n\n**Test Score Low**:\n→ Recommend prep course\n\n**Late Enrollment**:\n→ Manager approval required\n\n**Schedule Conflict**:\n→ Alternative time or flexible arrangement","x":800,"y":500,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"next-workflow","type":"file","file":"02-Workflows/WF-02 Teaching & Learning Cycle.md","x":400,"y":-300,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"next-arrow","type":"text","text":"After enrollment complete →\n**WF-02: Teaching & Learning begins**","x":400,"y":-180,"width":300,"height":80,"color":"3"}
	],
